usage: sample.py [-h] --method {full,sca,sca_uniform,sca_layer,sca_switch}
                 [--label LABEL] [--pi-table PI_TABLE] [--pi-scale PI_SCALE]
                 [--pi-const PI_CONST] [--sigma-star SIGMA_STAR] --res HxW
                 --prompts PROMPTS [--start START] [--end END] [--seed SEED]
                 [--steps STEPS] [--guidance GUIDANCE] --out OUT
                 [--mu-mode {max_shift,default}] [--n0 N0] [--tile TILE]
                 [--window WINDOW] [--pool {center,mean}]
                 [--gate-sigma GATE_SIGMA] [--band BAND] [--route ROUTE]
                 [--chunk CHUNK] [--local-impl {flex,gather}]
                 [--model {dev,krea}] [--device DEVICE]

Generate one resumable FLUX chunk with full attention or SCA. Output (PNG +
JSON sidecar per prompt, deterministic per-prompt seeds) matches
constancy_rope/scripts/sample.py, so its eval.py runs unchanged on --out.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --method {full,sca,sca_uniform,sca_layer,sca_switch}
  --label LABEL         Method name written to the sidecar (default --method);
                        use for ablations
  --pi-table PI_TABLE   npz from scripts/calibrate.py (required for sca
                        variants except sca_switch with --sigma-star and
                        sca_uniform with --pi-const)
  --pi-scale PI_SCALE   Calibrated scale to use (default: nearest to target
                        scale)
  --pi-const PI_CONST   Constant pi for every head and sigma (ablation)
  --sigma-star SIGMA_STAR
                        Switch point for sca_switch (default: fitted value)
  --res HxW
  --prompts PROMPTS
  --start START
  --end END
  --seed SEED
  --steps STEPS
  --guidance GUIDANCE
  --out OUT
  --mu-mode {max_shift,default}
  --n0 N0
  --tile TILE
  --window WINDOW
  --pool {center,mean}
  --gate-sigma GATE_SIGMA
                        Global-only (pi=0) above this sigma
  --band BAND           Low band (pool size, tokens) taken from O_glob
  --route ROUTE         Hard per-head routing threshold on pi (0 = soft mix)
  --chunk CHUNK         Query tiles per local-branch chunk, gather only
                        (default: 2 GiB budget)
  --local-impl {flex,gather}
                        Local branch implementation (same keys; flex uses a
                        FlexAttention block mask)
  --model {dev,krea}    dev = FLUX.1-dev; krea = FLUX.1-Krea-dev transformer
                        with FLUX.1-dev encoders and VAE
  --device DEVICE
